    ["So long."] = { ["source"] = "client_global_strings", ["tier"] = "validated_legacy" },
    ["So, I have this idea for a great movie.  It's about two Gnomes who find a bracelet of power, and they have to take it to the Burning Steppes and cast it into The Cauldron.  They form the Brotherhood of the Bracelet.  Along the way, they're trailed by a murloc named Gottom who's obsessed with the bracelet, and nine bracelet bogeymen.  It could be a three parter called \"Ruler of the Bracelet\".  The first part would be called \"The Brotherhood of the Bracelet\", followed by \"A Couple of Towers\", with the climactic ending called \"Hey, the King's Back\"."] = { ["source"] = "client_global_strings", ["tier"] = "validated_legacy" },
    ["So, an Orc walks into a bar with a parrot on his shoulder.  The bartender says, \"Hey, where'd you get that?\"  The parrot says, \"Durotar.  They got 'em all over the place.\""] = { ["source"] = "client_global_strings", ["tier"] = "validated_legacy" },
